+/* Stained Glass OS: the user's caption settings, kept as the ClosedCaption*
+ * enumeration values under HKCU\Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\
+ * ClosedCaptioning; what is not set (or not valid) is Default, as when the
